    "detailed_description": "Baccarat Corsair is 3D game that allows you to experience the excitement of baccarat.  In Baccarat Corsair you can enjoy the best gaming experience with stunning graphic and thrilling music.  If you don't want to play alone, you can also invite your friends to join your table to play together.<br />\r\nYou would also find interesting mini-games and game events for earning free game coins.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDo not miss the chance to have fun and try your luck!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey Features/Gameplay:<br />\r\n- join a table to play baccarat game<br />\r\n- multiple players can join the same table<br />\r\n- daily bonus and free coins bonus available every few hours<br />\r\n- mini-games available<br />\r\n- customizable avatar",
